+
+There are also built-in functions @code{__builtin_fabsf@var{n}},
+@code{__builtin_fabsf@var{n}x}, @code{__builtin_copysignf@var{n}} and
+@code{__builtin_copysignf@var{n}x}, corresponding to the TS 18661-3
